    "Workspace imports and local cn helper",
    "Resolve icon placeholders to Lucide",
    "Map font-heading to the shared token",
    "Sonner receives its theme from the consuming application",
    "Formatting and strict typing fixes",
    "Shared local Inter font and semantic theme tokens.",
    "Use style text children instead of raw HTML injection for chart CSS; stable chart series keys.",
    "Replace registry-only class markers with portable Tailwind utilities.",
    "Explicit label forwarding, semantic current breadcrumbs and field wrappers, and stable unique validation error keys.",
    "Match slider thumb count to scalar or array values, including the default value.",
    "Use the semantic muted-foreground token for inactive tabs instead of transparent foreground text to preserve accessible contrast.",
    "Target Recharts cartesian-axis-tick-value directly so the semantic tick color applies after Recharts 3.11 moved labels outside the tick group."
